# Kazuha Furina Fischl Xianyun. ~20s Rot. APL. (TF) Kazuha Taser in 2T. Xianyun plunges when Kazuha's Anemo plunges are not available. Note that in situations in which this team is ideal, Sac Sword and Vhunt offer additional value. Accomodates Kazuha constellations. 80% Collisions from Kazuha Skill, 50% From Starwicker plunges.

# Team- Option Listed by DPS
kazuha char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
kazuha add weapon="xiphos" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
#kazuha add weapon="sacsword" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
